Dialogue: 5,0:08:34.16,0:08:38.54,Text ENG,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Happy Birthday to You
Dialogue: 5,0:08:38.54,0:08:42.69,Text ENG,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Happy Birthday to You
Dialogue: 5,0:08:42.98,0:08:49.08,Text ENG,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Happy birthday, dear Lily-chan
Dialogue: 5,0:08:50.05,0:08:56.05,Text ENG,,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Happy Birthday to You
