Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.64,0:23:07.61,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}Anytime we love it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.61,0:23:11.12,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}日々更新される楽しさの理論値
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.12,0:23:12.80,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}So here’s the wonderland!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.80,0:23:14.62,EDJP,,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(1900,320)}Why don’t you come with me?
